    {
      "id": 172963,
      "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
      "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-04-14T06:20:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"grysqrl\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/grysqrl/48/1909_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> grysqrl:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Bloogo is protecting a Construct?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Ding Ding Ding! &nbsp;We have a winner!</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Specifically, Bloogo is protecting a Vitality Conduit which is attached to him. &nbsp;It causes them to get confused, and not know which zone to be in. &nbsp;Also, the Vitality Conduit didn't show up when Progeny was dealing damage to all heroes targets, and then the game stopped working.</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:56:00.101Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
