      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "[quote=\"grysqrl\"]\n\nBloogo is protecting a Construct?\n\n[/quote]\nDing Ding Ding! &nbsp;We have a winner!\n\n&nbsp;\n\nSpecifically, Bloogo is protecting a Vitality Conduit which is attached to him. &nbsp;It causes them to get confused, and not know which zone to be in. &nbsp;Also, the Vitality Conduit didn&#39;t show up when Progeny was dealing damage to all heroes targets, and then the game stopped working.\n",
